_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plaught-armor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T00:36:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T00:36:37Z","body":"This pull is causing CollisionShape3D errors. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3321998924/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322366223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322366223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322366223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GB0kP","user":{"login":"harrisyu","id":4844464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDQ0NjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4844464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu","html_url":"https://github.com/harrisyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrisyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T04:24:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T04:24:56Z","body":"This pull cause both 3D and 2D collision shape not detect by body.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322366223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322457883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322457883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322457883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GCK8b","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T05:23:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T06:16:46Z","body":"Can confirm that removing `static_ancestral_class` from `CollisionObject3D` solves the regression (for 3D), probably same for 2D.\r\n\r\nJust investigating why it is causing a problem (maybe a conflict for derived classes where it is trying to use ancestry).\r\n\r\nI suspect this line isn't working correctly for some inheritance chains, but I haven't figured it out yet:\r\n```\r\n\tif constexpr (T::static_ancestral_class != T::super_type::static_ancestral_class) {\r\n\t\treturn _has_ancestry(T::static_ancestral_class);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\treturn is_class_ptr(T::get_class_ptr_static());\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nInteresting that this problem doesn't seem to occur in 3.x, possibly because we are doing the same thing longhand and checking ancestry directly where it makes sense, or perhaps the inheritance chains are different.\r\n\r\nWill leave this to @Ivorforce when he's up.\r\n\r\nIf he's unavailable today I might be able to have a look at a fix, or we can just revert temporarily to prevent users having broken projects when using master, as the bug is quite annoying.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322457883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322675234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322675234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322675234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GDAAi","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T06:59:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T07:04:34Z","body":"Got it, it's actually my bad, rather than a problem with this PR, it's a problem with #107868 (which was merged just before this one, but this one exposed it).\r\n\r\n`PhysicsBody3D` has another constructor that avoids setting the ancestry, this may be a difference between 3.x and 4.x. I'll see if I can fix. (Or it's a fix I made to the 3.x PR but forgot to change on the 4.x PR and they got out of sync).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322675234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322813750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322813750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322813750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GDh02","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T07:48:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T07:49:10Z","body":"> This pull cause both 3D and 2D collision shape not detect by body.\r\n\r\n@harrisyu Although I've confirmed the bug with 3D, I haven't worked out yet how this could be affecting 2D collision shapes, do you have an MRP that shows this? (or even let me know if one of the demos isn't working correctly) ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322813750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322828010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322828010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322828010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GDlTq","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T07:54:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T07:58:27Z","body":"> > This pull cause both 3D and 2D collision shape not detect by body.\r\n> \r\n> @harrisyu Although I've confirmed the bug with 3D, I haven't worked out yet how this could be affecting 2D collision shapes, do you have an MRP that shows this? (or even let me know if one of the demos isn't working correctly)\r\n\r\nI see `PhysicsBody2D` has a constructor like `PhysicsBody3D` which also lacks explicit ancestry.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* There doesn't seem to be a `PHYSICS_BODY_2D` enum value, so I guess it's intended.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322828010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322845164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110763#issuecomment-3322845164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110763","id":3322845164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GDpfs","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.